1
00:00:00,800 --> 00:00:06,200
Every Indian D2C brand faces an overwhelming marketplace reality.

2
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:11,650
Thousands of product listings across Amazon, Flipkart, and Google Shopping.

3
00:00:12,800 --> 00:00:18,500
Unauthorized sellers, steep unauthorized discounts, and copied photography.

4
00:00:18,600 --> 00:00:25,300
Brand teams can find listings—but they struggle to determine which ones actually deserve investigation.

5
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:30,200
This is Beacontra.

6
00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:37,420
A visual and commercial investigation workspace that transforms live marketplace search and reverse-image matching into an evidence-backed review queue.

7
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:42,200
Everything starts in the Brand Vault.

8
00:00:42,300 --> 00:00:50,800
Here, a brand registers its ground truth: statutory MRP, expected price bands, authorized merchants, and canonical reference photography.

9
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:56,430
This benchmark prevents false alarms and anchors every subsequent scan.

10
00:00:57,800 --> 00:01:03,600
Through SerpApi Google Shopping, Beacontra scans live e-commerce offers in real time.

11
00:01:03,700 --> 00:01:11,500
Our deterministic SKU normalizer automatically excludes non-comparable accessories like silicone covers and cables.

12
00:01:11,600 --> 00:01:21,370
Instantly, an unauthorized listing at 1,399 rupees is flagged: an 81 percent price drop against the statutory MRP.

13
00:01:24,100 --> 00:01:29,200
Next, Visual Forensics submits listing thumbnails to SerpApi Google Lens.

14
00:01:29,300 --> 00:01:38,200
If Lens returns no matches, Beacontra is honest: it classifies the signal as neutral absence of evidence, never claiming counterfeit status without proof.

15
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:47,980
The Evidence Graph unifies every factual link—connecting brands to listings, merchants, and visual clusters.

16
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,200
Clicking Explain This Finding opens Beacontra's transparent heuristic engine.

17
00:01:55,300 --> 00:02:02,100
It displays exact mathematical weights: price deviation, unauthorized merchant penalty, and visual confidence.

18
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:10,520
It even runs a counterfactual simulation—showing how review priority changes if seller authorization is verified.

19
00:02:12,000 --> 00:02:18,500
Investigators can capture listings directly from the browser using the Beacontra Lens Chrome extension,

20
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:22,100
or file cases into the Cases Desk.

21
00:02:22,200 --> 00:02:28,200
With one click, Beacontra exports a standalone, print-ready HTML dossier—

22
00:02:28,300 --> 00:02:33,980
complete with cryptographic provenance, timestamped evidence, and defensible audit notes for legal and compliance teams.

23
00:02:36,000 --> 00:02:41,200
SerpApi delivers the live marketplace and visual data.

24
00:02:41,300 --> 00:02:45,500
Beacontra turns that data into evidence you can trust.

25
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:47,260
Every listing, a clearer signal.
